infographic compare-binary-horizontal-underline-text-vs
data
  title With the stack vs without: 35 minutes or all afternoon
  desc The same /checkout SLO burn — the five-signal stack turns an afternoon of guessing into a 35-minute resolve-and-enforce loop
  compares
    - label With the five-signal stack
      children
        - label 35 min: page to verified fix
          desc Profile, classify, trace, fix, verify — under one hour
        - label Root cause in ~9 min
          desc 60s observe + 90s profile + 60s classify + 5m trace
        - label Cross-service cause, not a symptom
          desc Profile + trace name the upstream payload 8 KB to 85 KB
        - label Fixed once, then enforced
          desc PR gate + payload alert + runbook block the whole class
    - label Without continuous profiling + traces
      children
        - label 4 to 8 hours for the incident alone
          desc No profile or trace to point at the cause
        - label An afternoon spent guessing
          desc GC + Marshal spikes invisible without continuous profiling
        - label Symptom fix leaves the root cause
          desc Patch /checkout allocations, the 85 KB payload stays
        - label Recurs in 3 to 6 months
          desc No gate — the same class pages the next on-call
theme
  palette #14b8a6 #f43f5e
